  "notes": "Sprint 140+ web dashboard SSE hook point implemented.\n\n## Baseline\nNo src/dashboard/api/ directory existed. No SSE endpoint existed.\n\n## Implementation\n1. Created src/dashboard/api/output-stream.ts (~220 LoC):\n   - writeSseHeaders(): sets Content-Type text/event-stream, Cache-Control, Connection, CORS headers\n   - writeSseEvent(): serializes events in SSE format (event/data/newline protocol)\n   - parseStreamQuery(): extracts taskId + sprintId from URL query string\n   - handleOutputStream(): main SSE handler — sends snapshot on connect, polls OutputCollector for new lines, sends done event when worker leaves active list, supports maxConnectionMs timeout, cleans up on client disconnect\n   - isOutputStreamRequest(): URL route matcher for GET /api/output-stream\n\n2. Created tests/dashboard/api/output-stream.test.ts (28 tests):\n   - writeSseEvent: correct format, closed response, destroyed response, complex payload\n   - writeSseHeaders: Content-Type, Cache-Control, Connection headers\n   - parseStreamQuery: taskId parsing, sprintId parsing, missing taskId (null), no query string (null), empty taskId (null), whitespace trimming, undefined url\n   - isOutputStreamRequest: match, no query string, wrong path, POST method, partial path\n   - handleOutputStream: 400 on missing taskId, snapshot on connect with data, empty snapshot when not registered, output event on new lines, done event when worker leaves, client disconnect cleanup, maxConnectionMs timeout, cleanup function stops polling\n\n## Verification\n- tsc --noEmit: 0 errors\n- npx vitest run --config src/dashboard/vitest.config.ts: 457 passed (16 test files, includes 28 new tests)\n- All dashboard tests green\n\n## Delta Assessment\n100% complete — interface surface fully implemented per task spec.",
